        "message": "TUI shell: Agents / Board / PRs screens over the Source trait\n\nBare `bf` now opens a ratatui screen: two-line status bar, list + detail\n(vertical under 85 columns), footer hints, help/confirm/input overlays,\nPalette honouring NO_COLOR / COLORTERM / indexed ANSI, loader thread on a\n2 s cadence, 100 ms input poll, RestoreTerminal guard. Non-tty and\nTERM=dumb print the plain snapshot and exit 0; BF_TUI_ONCE=1 renders one\nframe for tests. Data still comes from StubSource until the wiring PR.\n\nPlan of record PR 6: ~/.claude/plans/please-study-the-tips-snazzy-canyon.md\n\nbf-author: claude/claude-orch\nbf-claim: AGENT_CHAT.md 2026-09-18T16:34Z\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
